<title>BELGIUM: EU clears STET stake in Mobilkom Austria.</title>
<headline>EU clears STET stake in Mobilkom Austria.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Thursday it had cleared the acqusition by Italian telecoms group STET of a stake in Mobilkom Austria, a mobile phone operator currently fully owned by Post und Telekom Austria AG.</p>
<p>The Commission said that the acqusition carried out by STET Mobile Holding NV would not harm competition since STET did not previously have any operations in Austria.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
